meta {
  name: User - Member list
  type: http
  seq: 238
}

patch {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/user/member-list
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "show_in_member_list": false
  }
}

docs {
  Show or hide the current user in the member list of their communities (#1466): one choice for the account, true by default. false: the other members do not find the member in the member list, the member search or the mention suggestions (Members - List, Members - Search). The owner, the admins and the moderators with the manage members right still get the entry, with in_member_list false, and so does the member themself. A community where the member is the owner, an admin or a moderator always lists them. The member page, the posts, a typed mention, the online list (see User - Online status) and the member count do not change. Returns the current user with show_in_member_list. Needs user:write.
}
